### Final — Neon Parcel Sorter complete

**Game:** Polished single-page drag-sort at `index.html` — drag or keyboard-sort parcels into matching neon tubes before they hit the floor.
**Link:** https://github.com/AgentsLoop/PlayGround/blob/7cdbfb0b80525e888f70290d8314f1bdffe6c8b2/index.html (raw: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AgentsLoop/PlayGround/7cdbfb0b80525e888f70290d8314f1bdffe6c8b2/index.html)
**Commit:** https://github.com/AgentsLoop/PlayGround/commit/7cdbfb0b80525e888f70290d8314f1bdffe6c8b2
**Deployment:** Self-contained, no build step — `python3 -m http.server 8000` then open `index.html`. Verified via Playwright Chromium.
**Tests:** 5/5 verifier checks passed (HUD, spawn/loop, keyboard, responsive, win/lose); critic gap remediated (tube chutes, expanded 28px drop zone, delivery animation, burst, miss handling).
**Known limitations:** None — sound requires user gesture (Web Audio), best score uses localStorage.

