### Final — Neon Parcel Sorter complete

**Summary:** Polished single-page game — drag or keyboard-sort falling parcels (76x52) into 4 matching neon tube chutes (Cyan/Magenta/Yellow/Lime) before they hit the floor. Score +100 correct, -1 life wrong/miss, win at 2000 pts, lose at 0 lives (5 hearts), level every 400 pts with increasing fall speed and spawn rate.

**Public game link:** https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AgentsLoop/PlayGround/51ad0a32f22517ac2a03242bdb197740009195eb/index.html — also running locally at http://127.0.0.1:3000/index.html (tmux session app-server on port 3000, verified 200 OK)
**Final commit:** https://github.com/AgentsLoop/PlayGround/commit/51ad0a32f22517ac2a03242bdb197740009195eb

**Deployment status:** Self-contained, no build step — python3 -m http.server 3000 serves index.html with inline CSS/JS only, zero external dependencies.
