### Final — Neon Parcel Sorter complete

**Summary:** Polished single-page game — drag or keyboard-sort falling parcels (76x52) into 4 matching neon tube chutes (Cyan/Magenta/Yellow/Lime) before they hit the floor. Score +100 correct, -1 life wrong/miss, win at 2000 pts, lose at 0 lives (5 hearts), level every 400 pts with increasing fall speed and spawn rate. Tube highlights, snap delivery with shrink, burst particles, score pops, shake on miss.

**Public game link:** https://hawk-updates-stays-compile.trycloudflare.com
